OL,3,GNEWSAStalking laws must change to save
OL,4,Alives, family says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe review of current legislation by
OL,7,FRichard Wright KC was submitted to
OL,8,Fministers six months ago and its
OL,9,Ffindings have not yet been published.
OL,10,FClive Ruggles said: "We've got to do
OL,11,Fsomething about this and that involves
OL,12,Fjust the government acting - get this
OL,13,Freport out."
OL,15,FThe government said it was
OL,16,Fstrengthening the use of stalking
OL,17,Fprotection orders.
